## CASTABOT rebrand notice

This distribution is **CASTABOT**, an independently branded fork of
[Hermes Agent](https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent) by Nous Research.

The MIT license above is unchanged and remains in full force. Per its terms, the
original copyright notice and permission notice are retained verbatim in the
grant above. This fork:

- renames user-visible product branding (display names, banners, documentation,
  website and web UI text) from Hermes Agent to CASTABOT, and Nous Research to
  CastaSo;
- adds `NOTICE` describing the upstream project and the modifications made;
- makes **no functional change** to the licensed code. Internal identifiers,
  module names, the `hermes` command, the `HERMES_*` environment variables and
  the `~/.hermes` configuration directory are deliberately unchanged.

Copyright (c) 2026 CastaSo (modifications to the upstream work)

Upstream project: https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent
This distribution: https://github.com/castaso/CASTABOT

CASTABOT is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Nous Research.
"Hermes" and "Hermes Agent" are trademarks of Nous Research and are used here
only to identify the upstream project being redistributed.
